    "title": "Construction work on LaSalle planned to last three weeks in Bismarck - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Edward Segal No media credit provided. ,\n1 hours ago\nBISMARCK, ND ( KXNET ) — Construction season is continuing in Bismarck as a segment of E. LaSalle Drive will be closed for three weeks starting Thursday.\nThe road will be closed to through traffic from Ottawa St. to Normandy St.\nThe work is planned to last three weeks depending on weather, and drivers are encouraged to use alternate routes.\nTo see updates of all road construction projects currently underway in Bismarck, you can find a status map here .\nClose Thanks for signing up!\nWatch for us in your inbox.\nSubscribe Now\nToday's Top Stories Copyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to KX NEWS.",
